<title>USA: CNA Financial unit president named.</title>
<headline>CNA Financial unit president named.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Commercial Insurance, the largest business unit of CNA Financial Corp, said Wednesday it named Michael McGavick as president.</p>
<p>McGavick fills a post held by Tom Grzelinski, who retired in April.</p>
<p>McGavick joined CNA's marketing department in 1995 as group vice president responsible for new business ventures.</p>
